<title>UK: Credit Local sets 500 mln Ffr 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local sets 500 mln Ffr 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UGP and BFCM.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN FFR   COUPON    *5.44	MATURITY    16.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  100.95    PAY DATE    16.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  35 BP     REOFFER    100.00    SPREAD	+35 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   LISTING    PARIS     DENOMS (K)  FIVE</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR YEARS ONE TO FIVE THEN STEPS UP TO 7.23 PCT</p>
<p>		THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>		THERE IS A PAR CALL ON 16.JUN.02 TO GIVE A SPREAD</p>
<p>		OF 55 BP OVER BTAN (YTM 5.44 PCT)</p>
<p>- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
